## psc/cmd/stubs.pengu — comandos de fases posteriores.

import std.spark

insignia psc_cmd_stubs_

## Imprime un error de fase y devuelve 2.
##
## ## Memoria
## No retiene.
weave not_yet with cmd as string, phase as string into int:
    var s as string is "psc {cmd}: not available until {phase}"
    calling spark.eprintln with s
    banish s
    var h as string is "  See PLAN_F6_CLI.md / the issue tracker for the roadmap."
    calling spark.eprintln with h
    banish h
    return 2

